  "scenario": "A school canteen keeps ice for the cold drinks, and on hot afternoons it melts before the break ends. The canteen manager asks your science club: “What makes ice melt faster or slower, and what could we change to keep it frozen longer?” Plan and carry out your own investigation and give the manager evidence.",
  "outcomes": [
    "Ask a question you can test, and say what you will change and measure.",
    "Choose the equipment you need and set up a fair test.",
    "Run trials, record what happens and check that your result can be trusted.",
    "Explain what the evidence shows, using what you learned in the chapter."
  ],
